--- !u!114 &1713099863
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1713099860}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 34f5fff0a8ac2764bbfd6bfa00b0ea67, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  jumpToCombat: 0
  background1: {fileID: 2146437735}
  background2: {fileID: 1945078872}
  world: {fileID: 1514491354}
  purpleFlash: {fileID: 370452771}
  tundraWithNoise: {fileID: 1550036737}
  caveFlickerLayer: {fileID: 1592478426}
  jackie: {fileID: 1182050830}
  ives: {fileID: 1344997715}
  princess: {fileID: 1919315715}
  jayOpeningDialogue:
  - content: "Feel that breeze picking up? There\u2019s an opening up ahead!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403555872759611454
  preBonfireDialogue:
  - content: How close are we to the Frog, Jackie?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856385
    - rid: 4468675930332856389
    - rid: 4468675930332856387
    - rid: 4468675930332856388
    - rid: 4468675930332856390
  - content: "It should be just up ahead. We\u2019ve reached the same elevation."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 2403556212876771395
    - rid: 2403556212876771390
    - rid: 4468675930332856391
    - rid: 2403556212876771392
    - rid: 2403556212876771393
  - content: Then we should make preparations for battle.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856392
  - content: Jay, take the vanguard and the rest of your team up to get a good read
      on the situation.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: The rest of us will set up camp and secure the rear.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Gotcha, Captain.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856393
    - rid: 4468675930332856395
    - rid: 2403556212876771396
    - rid: 4468675930332856396
  - content: Jackie, give Jay your tracker.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856398
  - content: Sure, just give me a second.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856399
    - rid: 4468675930332856400
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856401
    - rid: 4468675930332856402
    - rid: 4468675930332856403
  postVisionDialogue:
  - content: <i>To the rest of the group, Jackie seemingly turns into an exact copy
      of the princess frog.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856404
  - content: <i>For a brief moment, the crown atop her head emanates some strange
      energy before Jackie turns back into a human.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Uncanny. Let me study that device of yours after all this, will you?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856405
    - rid: 4468675930332856406
    - rid: 4468675930332856407
    - rid: 4468675930332856408
    - rid: 4468675995853652145
  - content: Sure thing. Pretty neat, huh?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856409
    - rid: 4468675930332856412
    - rid: 4468675930332856410
    - rid: 4468675930332856411
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856417
    - rid: 4468675930332856418
  - content: <i>Jackie hands Jay the device.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856414
  - content: You gonna be okay with this, Jay? Any questions?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856415
    - rid: 4468675930332856416
    - rid: 4468675930332856419
    - rid: 4468675930332856420
    - rid: 4468675930332856421
  - content: "Nah, I think I\u2019ll be okay, teach."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856422
    - rid: 4468675930332856423
    - rid: 4468675930332856424
    - rid: 4468675930332856425
    - rid: 4468675930332856426
  - content: <i>After putting on the tracking device, Jay leads the scout team out
      of the caves.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856427
  - content: <i>In the meantime, the rest of the Wastelanders begin setting up their
      outpost. Before long, a large bonfire crackles in the center.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856428
    - rid: 4468675930332856429
  postBonfireDialogue:
  - content: <i>Jackie is cleaning her staff as Rocky approaches.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856430
  - content: Jackie?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856431
    - rid: 4468675930332856449
    - rid: 4468675930332856432
    - rid: 4468675930332856433
    - rid: 4468675930332856434
  - content: Yes?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856435
    - rid: 4468675930332856436
    - rid: 4468675930332856437
    - rid: 4468675930332856438
  - content: About earlier... I'd like to apologize for what I said.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856439
  - content: I judged you too quickly, and I'm sorry.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: It's alright, I get it. You just wanted to protect me.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856440
    - rid: 4468675930332856441
  - content: "Doesn\u2019t make it right."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856442
    - rid: 2403555872759611455
  - content: ...I think it's time I told you. About your mom. You okay to hear that?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856443
  - content: ...Yeah, yeah, I think so.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856445
    - rid: 4468675930332856446
  - content: I overheard you talking to Jay earlier.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675930332856444
  momStoryFlashbackDialogue:
  - content: So you know we were out here rescuing scouts.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372860990
  - content: "But there was something he didn\u2019t tell you. The reason for his
      expedition that started it all."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372860991
  - content: "He was tasked with tracking down a creature we call \u201CEntity X\u201D
      after it disappeared in the Tundra."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372860992
  - content: "It\u2019s a massive thing, capable of razing cities to the ground,
      and so our task as NITES was to keep tabs on it and figure out how to deal
      with it."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372860993
  - content: "That\u2019s when we discovered something... complicated."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372861015
    - rid: 4468675932372860994
    - rid: 4468675932372860995
    - rid: 4468675932372860996
    - rid: 4468675932372860997
    - rid: 4468675932372860998
    - rid: 4468675932372860999
  - content: We found that the crystals have the power to revert a living being infiltrated
      by the Waste.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: When crystals are given the chance to grow, they sap frequency from
      their surroundings and convert it to amplitude they can store.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "That\u2019s how we managed to bring everyone back. Those crystals that
      grow from them keep their infection in check."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: But this discovery divided our team. What we saw as comrades, the others
      saw as data.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372861000
  - content: They saw the Waste as something to be weaponized.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372861002
  - content: "With the knowledge that they\u2019d always be able to revert someone
      who\u2019d taken a step too far, they wanted to test the limits of Waste enhancement.
      To take Entity X head on."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372861003
  - content: But we saw an opportunity to recover, to further Waste crystal research
      and use it to restore our comrades. Protect our city.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372861004
    - rid: 4468675932372861005
  - content: And so Ailin stepped in.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372861006
  - content: She entertained both sides. But her final decision was absolute.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372861007
  - content: Waste enhancement research would only hinder the progress of saving
      the scouts.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372861008
    - rid: 4468675932372861009
  - content: The scientists believed she was biased, but no one dared to defy her
      order.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372861010
  - content: Except for one man. The inventor of the Anti-Waste Serums.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372861011
  - content: On one of our last missions out, he set us up.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372861012
  - content: After subduing a group of affected scouts, we injected them with modified
      Anti-Waste Serums to stabilize them.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "But we didn\u2019t realize the serums were tampered with."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Something in the serum altered the scouts. They tore apart the medical
      team in seconds.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "We might have been able to contain the threat if not for the fact that\u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Ailin had been injected too.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: The scientist, that bastard, he just watched as she collapsed.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Since she wasn\u2019t already infected by the Waste, her transformation
      took longer."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Knowing what your mother was capable of already, we ran. And by the
      time we circled back, she was gone. And the others were dead.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "We don\u2019t know what happened to her. But we hope she\u2019s still
      out there."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372861013
    - rid: 4468675932372861014
  weiseDialogue:
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675932372861016
    - rid: 4468675932372861017
    - rid: 4468675932372861019
    - rid: 4468675932372861020
    - rid: 4468675932372861021
  - content: ...I see.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652146
    - rid: 4468675995853652148
  - content: "Jackie drifts into quiet thought. She realized she\u2019d been bracing
      for the worst. As if ready to accept that her pursuit was over."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132606
  - content: Now, she was left to contemplate this fragile strand of hope. Cheery
      voices interrupted her mire. Jay was back.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132607
  - content: "Captain, I\u2019ve got good news and bad."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132608
    - rid: 4468675976161132609
    - rid: 4468675976161132610
    - rid: 4468675976161132613
    - rid: 4468675976161132611
    - rid: 4468675976161132612
  - content: "Let\u2019s hear the good."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132614
    - rid: 4468675976161132615
    - rid: 4468675976161132616
    - rid: 4468675976161132617
    - rid: 4468675976161132618
  - content: Well, all of the team is down there, still alive and whole.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132619
  - content: And the bad?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132620
  - content: "They won\u2019t be for long. It's freezing. If they stay out there,
      they\u2019ll be dead in an hour."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132621
  - content: "And we're outnumbered. We\u2019re already one to one with our own scouts,
      without counting the million other creatures down there."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132622
  - content: Is there any way to isolate them? Get them out one by one?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132623
  - content: Not likely. They're spread out, so getting to one might alert the others.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132624
  - content: Dammit. We need more manpower. Or a miracle.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132625
  - content: <i>Just then, a commotion begins to stir at the rear of the cave.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132626
  - content: <i>First, shouts of alarm. Then incredulous exclamations.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132627
  - content: "Heard y\u2019all were short on miracles."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132628
    - rid: 4468675976161132629
    - rid: 4468675976161132630
    - rid: 4468675976161132631
  - content: Ives!?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132632
    - rid: 4468675976161132633
    - rid: 4468675976161132634
    - rid: 4468675976161132636
  - content: "That\u2019s my name."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132637
    - rid: 4468675976161132638
  - content: How... how are you here?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132639
    - rid: 4468675976161132641
  - content: Little bird sent a reply.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132640
    - rid: 4468675976161132642
  - content: Well, you couldn't have shown up at a better time. We need muscle.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132643
  - content: Then let's talk tactics.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132644
    - rid: 4468675976161132645
  - content: <i>The cavern comes alive with cheerful reunions. Old friends coming
      together once more.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132646
  - content: Ives. You look terrible.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132647
    - rid: 4468675976161132648
    - rid: 4468675976161132649
    - rid: 4468675976161132652
    - rid: 4468675976161132650
    - rid: 4468675976161132651
    - rid: 4468675976161132653
  - content: "Hah, it\u2019s nice to see you too, Kade."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132654
    - rid: 4468675976161132655
  - content: "Skin is graying. Pupils dilated. Tremors. You\u2019re on high-grade
      amplitude suppressants."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132656
    - rid: 4468675976161132657
  - content: Perceptive as always.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132658
    - rid: 4468675976161132659
  - content: Guilty as charged. Got tangled up in a little Waste incident.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132660
    - rid: 4468675976161132661
  - content: If your dosage is even slightly off, the number of crystals here will
      tear you apart.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132662
    - rid: 4468675976161132663
  - content: "Good thing we brought the expert then. Haven\u2019t had any problems
      so far, even with the crystal run-ins on the way here."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132664
    - rid: 4468675976161132665
  - content: Hey, Doc! Front and center.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132666
    - rid: 4468675976161132667
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132668
    - rid: 4468675976161132669
    - rid: 4468675976161132670
  - content: <i>Dr. Weise steps out from the shadows. His face is neutral and hands
      dug stiffly into the pockets of his lab coat.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132671
  - content: "Now\u2019s hardly the time for acclaims, Commander."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd235c1504bece47bf25a48c0eb2480, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132672
    - rid: 4468675976161132673
    - rid: 4468675976161132674
    - rid: 4468675976161132687
  - content: <i>Kade freezes, her facing growing pale, then red.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132675
  - content: ...You. Aleksander.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132676
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd235c1504bece47bf25a48c0eb2480, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132677
    - rid: 4468675976161132678
  - content: Do I know you, miss?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd235c1504bece47bf25a48c0eb2480, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132679
    - rid: 4468675976161132680
  - content: Don't play dumb. What are you here for? More samples? To finish what
      you started?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132681
  - content: I assure you, we are only here for Jackie.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd235c1504bece47bf25a48c0eb2480, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132682
    - rid: 4468675976161132683
  - content: "Bullshit. If you really cared about Jackie, you wouldn\u2019t have
      taken her mother from her."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132684
  - content: You must have me confused with someone else. I have no idea what you
      are talking about.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd235c1504bece47bf25a48c0eb2480, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675976161132685
    - rid: 4468675976161132686
  - content: No. You did take her!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651968
    - rid: 4468675995853651969
    - rid: 4468675995853651970
    - rid: 4468675995853651971
    - rid: 4468675995853651972
    - rid: 4468675995853651973
  - content: "Jackie, please. The stress is clearly getting to you. We\u2019ve come
      to bring you home."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd235c1504bece47bf25a48c0eb2480, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651974
    - rid: 4468675995853651975
  - content: "No! I\u2019ve seen first-hand how careful the Waste survivors here
      are around crystals."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651976
  - content: "Kade mentioned earlier that Ives\u2019 suppressants must be matched
      exactly to keep her safe from these crystals."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651977
  - content: To keep her condition stable all the way out here... You would have
      to know exactly how the crystals in this Tundra interact with a Waste infection.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651978
    - rid: 4468675995853651979
  - content: You know. Because you've tested on them here before.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651980
  - content: When my mom disappeared.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651981
    - rid: 4468675995853651982
  - content: "W-What!? That\u2019s ridiculous, it is simply a fortunate happenstan\u2014"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd235c1504bece47bf25a48c0eb2480, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651983
    - rid: 4468675995853651984
  - content: "...I\u2019ve heard enough."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651985
    - rid: 4468675995853651986
    - rid: 4468675995853651987
    - rid: 4468675995853651990
    - rid: 4468675995853651988
    - rid: 4468675995853651989
  - content: I trust Kade, and I trust Jackie.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651991
  - content: "And I promised Cam that if I ever found a person who knew about all
      this... I\u2019d like to have some words with them."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651992
  - content: So let's chat.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651993
  - content: What the hell did you do to Ailin?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651994
    - rid: 4468675995853652000
  - content: Ives steps forward, towering over the doctor. Weise backs up until he
      hits the cave wall.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651995
  - content: "...W-What did I do? Well\u2026 let me show you!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd235c1504bece47bf25a48c0eb2480, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651996
  - content: Dr. Weise rips a syringe from his coat, jamming it into Ives' upper
      thigh.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651998
  - content: "ARGH! You\u2014!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853651999
    - rid: 4468675995853652001
  - content: Before Ives can restrain Dr. Weise, she loses all strength in her leg
      and falls to the floor, convulsing. Her skin, rippling purple.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652002
  - content: Jackie, get back! She's turning!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652003
    - rid: 4468675995853652004
    - rid: 4468675995853652005
    - rid: 4468675995853652006
    - rid: 4468675995853652007
    - rid: 4468675995853652008
    - rid: 4468675995853652009
  - content: Soon, a pulse of pervasive energy extends through the cave. Ives stands
      up. Her eyes are gone, replaced by glowing violet. She is calm.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652010
  - content: Weise steps behind her, using her massive form as a shield. He keeps
      one hand in his pocket.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652011
  - content: Anyone else want a demonstration? No? Then I suggest you let us pass.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd235c1504bece47bf25a48c0eb2480, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652012
    - rid: 4468675995853652013
  - content: "Pressing close behind Ives, he begins backing toward the exit. Ives\u2019
      marches perfectly ahead."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652014
  - content: Rocky, I have the shot!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652015
  - content: No! You'll hit Ives!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652016
    - rid: 4468675995853652017
    - rid: 4468675995853652019
    - rid: 4468675995853652020
    - rid: 4468675995853652118
  - content: "Let him go, he\u2019s got more injections. The madman plans to use
      it on anyone that gets close, or on Ives again."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652021
    - rid: 4468675995853652022
    - rid: 4468675995853652023
    - rid: 4468675995853652024
    - rid: 4468675995853652025
    - rid: 4468675995853652119
  - content: "He won't survive long out there in the cold alone. We\u2019ll get Ives
      back, don\u2019t worry."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652026
  - content: Everyone else! Battle stations! We are getting our people back!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652027
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652120
    - rid: 4468675995853652121
    - rid: 4468675995853652122
  spottedPFrogDialogue:
  - content: "Rocky, I see the princess frog ahead, where\u2019s backup?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652028
    - rid: 4468675995853652029
    - rid: 4468675995853652033
    - rid: 4468675995853652034
    - rid: 4468675995853652035
  - content: "The NITES are being held up by the Waste creatures, how\u2019s Jay\u2019s
      team doing?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652036
    - rid: 4468675995853652037
    - rid: 4468675995853652038
    - rid: 4468675995853652039
    - rid: 4468675995853652040
  - content: "We\u2019re being held back by the scouts, we won\u2019t be able to
      get there."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652041
    - rid: 4468675995853652042
    - rid: 4468675995853652043
    - rid: 4468675995853652044
  - content: "Dammit, then it\u2019s up to you Jackie. You have permission to engage,
      but get out of there if it's too much to handle."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652045
  - content: On it.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652046
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652123
    - rid: 4468675995853652124
    - rid: 4468675995853652125
  battleStartDialogue:
  - content: Crap.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652047
    - rid: 4468675995853652052
    - rid: 4468675995853652053
    - rid: 4468675995853652054
  - content: Looks like it's come to this.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652048
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 4468675995853652144
